      "message": "Short-term hack for R seems okay-ish, just two comments to ensure we\u0027ve really exhausted the (IMO) better solution:\n\n- I wonder if `conscrypt-host` really needs to set installable: true?\n\n- IIUC you\u0027re saying framework-minus-apex is not getting hiddenapi-encoded? We want it to be hiddenapi encoded, this is the module that ends up on device. The module called framework is purely meant for build-time use.",
